{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f1c4a2-0e5d-4c31-9a77-1d2e3f4a5b60",
    "name": "Replication Control Plane (Go + Meltano)",
    "description": "Collection untuk control plane di `controlplane/`. Isinya disinkronkan dengan route yang benar-benar terdaftar di `internal/api/server.go` (27 endpoint, 38 request termasuk kasus negatif). Urutan folder sudah benar: jalankan dari atas ke bawah, atau pakai Collection Runner. ID otomatis tersimpan ke variable sehingga request berikutnya tidak perlu diedit manual.\n\nPrasyarat:\n- Control plane jalan: `CP_EMBEDDED_WORKER=true go run ./cmd/control-plane`\n- Untuk mode tenant pada `GET /v1/connectors` dan eksekusi Meltano sungguhan, set juga `CP_MELTANO_BIN` dan `CP_TENANTS_ROOT`.\n- Jalankan `go run ./cmd/provision -tenant <nama> -extractor tap-mysql -loader target-postgres` sekali sebelum run.\n\nCatatan:\n- Workspace, connection, dan pipeline mendukung `PATCH` untuk edit dan `DELETE` untuk hapus. Run bersifat immutable.\n- `POST /runs` mengembalikan 409 bila pipeline sudah punya run aktif.\n- Delete connection ditolak selama pipeline masih memakainya; delete tenant/pipeline ditolak selama run masih aktif.\n- `GET /v1/connectors` tanpa `tenant_id` mengembalikan katalog statis; dengan `tenant_id` ia membaca `meltano plugin list --format=json` milik project tenant.\n- `GET /v1/runs/{id}/logs` mengembalikan progress, stream, jumlah record, dan tail log eksekusi.\n- Folder `6 - Cancel, Retry & Cleanup` harus dijalankan paling akhir karena menghapus resource.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Idempotency-Key baru untuk setiap request, mengikuti format UUID v4.",
          "pm.variables.set('idempotencyKey', 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g, function (c) {",
          "    var r = Math.random() * 16 | 0;",
          "    var v = c === 'x' ? r : (r & 0x3 | 0x8);",
          "    return v.toString(16);",
          "}));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tenantName", "value": "acme" },
    { "key": "environmentName", "value": "acme" },
    { "key": "connectorDriver", "value": "postgres" },
    { "key": "extractorName", "value": "tap-postgres" },
    { "key": "loaderName", "value": "target-postgres" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "sourceConnectionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "destinationConnectionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pipelineId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "deletedPipelineId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "runId", "value": "" }
  ],
